OL,3,GNEWSAWeight-loss jab boom brings
OL,4,Aneedles warning for recyclers
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe boom in injectable weight-loss
OL,7,Fdrugs, such as Mounjaro and Wegovy, is
OL,8,Fleading to more used needles turning up
OL,9,Fat recycling centres, putting workers
OL,10,Fat risk of serious injury and
OL,11,Finfection, bosses say.
OL,13,FAt a recycling plant in Coventry, I
OL,14,Fwatched staff sorting rubbish on a
OL,15,Ffast-moving conveyor belt when a
OL,16,Fcrushed yellow sharps container
OL,17,Fsuddenly appeared among the waste.
OL,19,F"A resident has put this in a wheelie
OL,20,Fbin," explained supervisor Paul Pagett.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,354,350,200,160,0,100
